'', '# Corrections and qualifications to the supplied results and leads', '',
'- R1 and R2: the used lifting, uniqueness and odd-deck-freeness steps were checked. The geometric prime-to-p group retains the full arithmetic quotient. No single Jacobian equality is reversed into a whole-group equality; the reverse implication uses a compatible cofinal path tower.',
